{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#card-zh","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-splash 是为 DeepSeek Harness 桌面端提供启动动画的 DSH 插件。它在 webServer 的 index-inject 阶段向渲染页注入全屏覆盖层，依次展示亮白跑马灯、逐笔写出的 DeepSeek Harness 字样、下划线和鱼形标志，随后自动淡出。插件还提供状态接口、图形配置面板、动画预览，并可切换启用状态、每窗口播放次数、点击跳过和检测原生补丁后让位等选项。适合希望自定义 DSH 主窗口启动呈现的桌面用户；配置保存在 DSH_HOME 下，无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:352-380","lib/index.js:389-454","assets/splash-overlay.js:6-45"]}
{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#card-en","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-splash adds a startup animation to DeepSeek Harness desktop. It injects an overlay with marquee lights, a drawn wordmark, and logo, then fades it away. A panel provides status, configuration, and preview. Settings control playback and click-to-skip; no API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:352-380","lib/index.js:389-454","assets/splash-overlay.js:6-45"]}
