{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#feature-startup-overlay","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-splash 的功能「启动覆盖动画」：在 DSH 渲染页注入全屏动画，依次播放跑马灯、逐笔字标、下划线和标志，完成后移除覆盖层。动画随 index-inject 注入脚本启动。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:363-384","assets/splash-overlay.js:6-45"]}
{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#feature-settings-panel","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-splash 的功能「配置面板」：通过本机面板查看状态、切换动画启用、每窗口播放、点击跳过及原生补丁让位选项；更改写入配置文件，需重启 DSH 才影响启动注入。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:72-94","lib/index.js:242-279"]}
