{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#feature-native-detection","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-splash 的功能「原生补丁检测」：检查 DSH app.asar 中的启动补丁标记；检测到且启用让位选项时，插件不再注入动画，避免两种启动画面同时出现。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:96-138","lib/index.js:162-184"]}
{"unit_id":"www02310__dsh-go#caveat-local-settings","repo":"www02310/dsh-go","commit":"f05f34f9fe28e677ba6288250451200d478e7be7","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-splash 将面板修改保存到 DSH_HOME/splash/config.json，并写入本地插件日志；配置更新后需重启 DSH 才会改变启动时注入行为。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:28-32","lib/index.js:82-94","lib/index.js:154-159"]}
